          "startMs": 52276,
          "endMs": 59620,
          "text": "बहुत सुंदर याद है। आज हम कुछ आसान साँस लेने के अभ्यास करेंगे।",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 60320,
          "endMs": 65408,
          "text": "ठीक है, आपसे बात करके थोड़ा हल्का महसूस हो रहा है।",
          "emotion": "CALM"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "real_indian_english_male_consultant_female_patient",
      "file": "../../e2e/fixtures/real_indian_english_male_consultant_female_patient.mp3",
      "turns": [
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 6000,
          "text": "Good evening. Please have a seat. How was your week?",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 6500,
          "endMs": 15836,
          "text": "Honestly, terrible. My manager shouted at me in front of the whole team and I was so angry I could not even speak.",
          "emotion": "ANGER"
        },
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 16736,
          "endMs": 22208,
          "text": "That sounds humiliating. What did you do after the meeting?",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 22808,
          "endMs": 31592,
          "text": "I went home and kept replaying it. Yaar, I am so frustrated, I work so hard and nobody notices.",
          "emotion": "FRUSTRATION"
        },
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 32692,
          "endMs": 37468,
          "text": "Is there anything that helps you unwind when you feel like this?",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 37868,
          "endMs": 46484,
          "text": "Music helps. Last night I listened to old songs on the balcony and finally felt relaxed for a while.",
          "emotion": "RELAXATION"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "real_two_male_voices",
      "file": "../../e2e/fixtures/real_two_male_voices.mp3",
      "turns": [
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 5232,
          "text": "Hello, please come in. How have you been sleeping lately?",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 5732,
          "endMs": 13604,
          "text": "बिल्कुल अच्छी नींद नहीं आ रही। हर समय चिंता लगी रहती है कि नौकरी चली जाएगी।",
          "emotion": "ANXIETY"
        },
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 14504,
          "endMs": 19208,
          "text": "That worry sounds constant. When did it start?",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 19808,
          "endMs": 28328,
          "text": "दो महीने पहले कंपनी में छँटनी हुई थी। तब से डर लगता है और मन उदास रहता है।",
          "emotion": "SADNESS"
        },
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 29428,
          "endMs": 34540,
          "text": "Thank you for telling me. Let us work on this together.",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 34940,
          "endMs": 40652,
          "text": "जी, धन्यवाद। उम्मीद है धीरे धीरे सब ठीक होगा।",
          "emotion": "CALM"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "real_two_female_voices",
      "file": "../../e2e/fixtures/real_two_female_voices.mp3",
      "turns": [
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 4584,
          "text": "आइए, बैठिए। आज आप कैसी हैं?",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 5084,
          "endMs": 13052,
          "text": "I am very anxious today. My daughter's exams are next week and I keep worrying about everything.",
          "emotion": "ANXIETY"
        },
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 13952,
          "endMs": 19232,
          "text": "समझ सकती हूँ। आप अपने लिए क्या करती हैं?",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 19832,
          "endMs": 28328,
          "text": "Nothing really. I miss the days when I used to paint and sing. I felt so happy back then.",
          "emotion": "NOSTALGIA"
        },
        {
          "role": "HEALTH_CONSULTANT",
          "startMs": 29428,
          "endMs": 34348,
          "text": "शायद हम फिर से उन चीज़ों के लिए समय निकाल सकते हैं।",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 34748,
          "endMs": 40940,
          "text": "Yes, I would love that. Just talking about it makes me smile.",
          "emotion": "JOY"
