          "endMs": 16616,
          "text": "Does anything in particular trigger it?",
          "emotion": null
        },
        {
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "startMs": 17216,
          "endMs": 24752,
          "text": "Work, mostly. And I am nervous all the time that I will make a mistake and lose my job.",
          "emotion": "ANXIETY"
